" crossorigin="anonymous"></audio><div class="tw-h-full tw-flex tw-items-center"><div class="-tw-mt-9 tw-relative tw-isolate tw-bg-white tw-rounded-3xl tw-w-full tw-mx-auto tw-ring-0.5 tw-ring-inset tw-ring-gray-200 tw-max-w-[37rem]"><div class=""><div class="tw-relative tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-flex-auto tw-overflow-y-auto tw-scroll-pt-4 tw-scroll-pb-6 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-scrollbar-none tw-h-40"><div class="tw-relative tw-flex-auto tw-flex tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-relative tw-flex-auto"><div class="tw-px-5 tw-text-base/base tw-text-black tw-caret-focus tw-outline-none tw-pt-4" style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:break-word" inert="">In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[sarcastically]</span> Not the “burn it all down” kind... <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[giggles]</span> but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. <span class="tw-text-gray-400">[whispers]</span> Even the birds fell silent when he passed.<!-- -->​</div><textarea class="tw-px-5 tw-text-base/base tw-text-black tw-caret-focus tw-outline-none tw-pt-4" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;resize:none;color:transparent;background-color:transparent" spellCheck="false" aria-label="Enter your text here, ElevenLabs AI Voice Generator will read it for you" maxLength="1000">In the ancient land of Eldoria, where skies shimmered and forests, whispered secrets to the wind, lived a dragon named Zephyros. [sarcastically] Not the “burn it all down” kind... [giggles] but he was gentle, wise, with eyes like old stars. [whispers] Even the birds fell silent when he passed.</textarea></div></div><div class="tw-flex-none tw-sticky tw-bottom-0 tw-h-6 tw-bg-gradient-to-t tw-from-white tw-mx-[0.5px]"></div></div><div class="tw-relative tw-z-10 tw-flex tw-items-center tw-px-3 tw-pb-3"><template><div class="tw-sticky tw-z-50 tw-h-1.5 tw-top-