ass=""><div class="tw-absolute tw-z-20 tw-flex tw-size-5 tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-full tw-left-0 tw-top-0 -tw-translate-x-1/2 -tw-translate-y-1/2" style="background-color:var(--marker-background-color, #FDFCFC)"><div class="tw-rounded-full tw-bg-black tw-size-0.5"></div></div><div class="tw-absolute tw-z-20 tw-flex tw-size-5 tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-full tw-right-0 tw-top-0 -tw-translate-y-1/2 tw-translate-x-1/2" style="background-color:var(--marker-background-color, #FDFCFC)"><div class="tw-rounded-full tw-bg-black tw-size-0.5"></div></div><div class="mt-0.5 h-1 w-full bg-overlay-dark"></div><div class="absolute top-0 h-1 w-full bg-overlay-dark" style="width:calc(50vw - 50%);left:calc(-50vw + 50%)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 h-1 w-full bg-overlay-dark" style="width:calc(50vw - 50%);right:calc(-50vw + 50%)"></div></div><div class="px-[var(--page-section-px)] [--page-section-px:0rem] pb-0 md:pb-0 pt-0 [--full-bleed:var(--page-section-px)]"><div class="blocks"><div class="tw-grid tw-grid-cols-1 lg:tw-grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto_minmax(0,1fr)]"><div class="tw-relative tw-px-4 md:tw-px-12 tw-text-pretty tw-py-12 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between"><div class="tw-hidden lg:tw-contents"><div class="tw-absolute tw-z-20 tw-flex tw-size-5 tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-full tw-right-0 tw-top-0 -tw-translate-y-1/2 tw-translate-x-1/2" style="background-color:var(--marker-background-color, #FDFCFC)"><div class="tw-rounded-full tw-bg-black tw-size-0.5"></div></div><div class="tw-absolute tw-z-20 tw-flex tw-size-5 tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-full tw-bottom-0 tw-right-0 tw-translate-x-1/2 tw-translate-y-1/2" style="background-color:var(--marker-background-color, #FDFCFC)"><div class="tw-rounded-full tw-bg-black tw-size-0.5"></div></div></div><div><h3 class="tw-type-xl tw-text-black">Text to Speech API</h3><div class="tw-mt-4 tw-type-base tw-text-gray-500 [&amp;_a]:tw-underline [&amp;_a]:tw-decoration-gray-300 [&amp;_a]:tw-underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:tw-decoration-gray-400 [&amp;_a]:tw-transition-colors [&amp;_a]:tw-rounded-sm [&amp;_a]:tw-outline-none focus-visible:[&amp;_a]:tw-outline-focus"><p>Independently rated the leading Text to Speech models. Choose a model to optimize for consistency, latency or emotional control. All support 29+ languages.</p></div><div class="tw-grid tw-gap-8 tw-grid-cols-1 sm:tw-grid-cols-2 tw-mt-12"><div><h4 class="tw-type-sm tw-text-black">Eleven Flash</h4><p class="tw-type-sm tw-mt-3 tw-text-gray-500">75ms latency for conversational usecases</p></div><div><h4 class="tw-type-sm tw-text-black">Eleven Multilingual</h4><p class="tw-type-sm tw-mt-3 tw-text-gray-500">Best lifelike consistent speech</p></div><div><h4 class="tw-type-sm tw-text-black">Eleven v3</h4><p class="tw-type-sm tw-mt-3 tw-text-gray-500">Our most expressive model yet</p></div></div></div></div><div class="tw-hidden tw-w-px lg:tw-block tw-bg-black/5"></div><div class="tw-px-4 tw-pb-4 lg:tw-pt-4 tw-flex"><div class="tw-group/code tw-bg-white tw-rounded-2.5xl tw-flex tw-w-full tw-relative tw-overflow-hidden has-[&gt;:focus-visible]:tw-outline-focus" style="box-shadow:0 0 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.4), 0 1px 1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04), 0 2px 4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04)"><div class="tw-overflow-auto tw-outline-none tw-w-full tw-py-6 tw-rounded-3xl tw-flex tw-scrollbar-none" aria-label="Text to speech API TypeScript example"><div class="tw-sticky tw-left-0 tw-w-6 tw-flex-none" style="background:linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 1) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98726) 8.07%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95141) 15.54%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.896) 22.5%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82459) 29.04%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74074) 35.26%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.648) 41.25%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.54993) 47.1%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45007) 52.9%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.352) 58.75%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25926) 64.74%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.17541) 70.96%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.104) 77.5%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04859) 84.46%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01274) 91.93%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 100%)"></div><pre style="font-variant-ligatures:none" class="[&amp;_code]:tw-font-mono [&amp;_code]:tw-block tw-text-2xs/[1.375rem] tw-text-black"><code><span style="color:#F41A2F">import</span> { ElevenLabsClient } <span style="color:#F41A2F">from</span><span style="color:#052F70"> "@elevenlabs/elevenlabs-js"</span>;

