ord it now. The recording should be 10-30 seconds long for ideal cloning.\",\"recording\":\"Recording\",\"your_recording\":\"Original voice\",\"finish_cloning_voice\":\"Finish cloning voice\",\"login_to_start\":\"Subscribe to clone voice\",\"signup_cta\":\"Sign up for free to use your voice in voiceovers, audiobooks, and effortless script-to-audio creation.\",\"error_file_generic\":\"\\\"{fileName}\\\" could not be processed. Please try another file.\",\"error_file_invalid_type\":\"\\\"{fileName}\\\" is not supported. Please choose an audio file.\",\"error_file_too_large\":\"\\\"{fileName}\\\" exceeds the {maxSize}MB size limit.\",\"generate_coming_soon_title\":\"Generate voice clone\",\"generate_coming_soon_description\":\"This feature will be implemented soon.\",\"upload_error_title\":\"Upload failed\",\"upload_error_description\":\"Something went wrong while uploading your recording. Please try again.\",\"recording_too_short\":\"At least {minSeconds} seconds of audio are required to clone your voice\",\"aria_restart\":\"Restart\",\"nudge_cta\":\"Clone your voice for free in seconds • Trusted by 1M+ creators\",\"nudge_cta_short\":\"Try free • Trusted by 1M+ creators\"},\"VoiceChangerV2\":{\"tab_examples\":\"Examples\",\"tab_change_your_voice\":\"Change your voice\",\"default_header_title\":\"Change your voice\",\"default_header_description\":\"Try Voice Changer to transform your voice in seconds\",\"upload_a_recording\":\"Upload a recording\",\"record_your_voice\":\"Record your voice\",\"recording_instructions\":\"Record at least 10 seconds of audio without background noise, or 30 seconds for ideal quality.\",\"upload_instructions\":\"Upload a recording with clear audio or record it now to transform your voice into another one.\",\"recording\":\"Recording\",\"your_recording\":\"Original voice\",\"finish_changing_voice\":\"Finish changing voice\",\"login_to_start\":\"Subscribe to change voice\",\"signup_cta\":\"Sign up for free to transform your voice for voiceover